
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge,chrome=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>
      Validation request - The Cambridge Crystallographic Data Centre (CCDC)
    </title>
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
        background-color: #bdbdbd;
        font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 18px !important;
      }
      h3 {
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }
      hr {
        background-color: #bdbdbd;
        border: 0;
        height: 1px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 10px;
        color: #4a4949;
        margin: 50px auto;
        padding: 40px 50px 40px 50px;
        width: 620px;
      }
      .container A,
      .container .container A:visited {
        color: #428bca;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn {
        background-image: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        border-radius: 4px;
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.42857143;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        padding: 6px 12px;
        text-align: center;
        vertical-align: middle;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        background-color: #337ab7;
        border-color: #2e6da4;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .form-group {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      input.form-control {
        padding: 4px 6px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <img
        style="height: 62px"
        alt="The Cambridge Crystallographic Data Centre (CCDC)"
        src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"
      />
      <p>
        To allow us to maintain this free service for the community please
        confirm you are not a robot and that you agree to the terms and
        conditions of this service before proceeding.
      </p>

      <p>
        Please type the text you see in the image into the text box and accept
        the terms and conditions to continue.
      </p>
      <form
        name="input"
        action="/captcha_resp"
        method="POST"
        enctype="application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
      >
        <table style="width: 100%">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <img src="/captcha.gif" /><br />
                <input
                  class="form-control"
                  type="text"
                  name="captcha_resp_txt"
                />
              </td>
              <td>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">
                  I accept the terms and conditions
                </button>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </form>
      <p>
        For more information about our data access policies and terms and
        conditions for use of Access Structures, please read
        <a href="https://www.ccdc.cam.ac.uk/access-structures-terms"
          >about this service</a
        >. These measures are in place to allow us to maintain free services and
        ensure that our ability to make data widely available to the community
        is not compromised.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        If you would like to undertake systematic searching, retrieval and
        analysis of crystal structures then this can be done through the CSD
        System which also provides for advanced programmatic access through a
        powerful Python API. If you would like more information on the CSD
        System or you would like to discuss research opportunities, please
        contact us through our
        <a
          href="https://www.ccdc.cam.ac.uk/theccdcprofile/contactus/Enquiry/generic"
          >Enquiry Page</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
